922 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 292 0 R
/E (These individuals represent a range of roles across retail, corporate, and related luxury sectors. While all of the companies fall under the LVMH group, the interviews highlight that the beauty industry and other luxury sectors can operate quite differently in terms of structure, pace, and career pathways. These differences are still useful for students as a point of comparison to better understand their own fit within these industries and to gain a broader perspective on how the LVMH ecosystem operates. They should be understood as providing general guidance on the European job market and how it may translate to Sephora and the beauty industry.)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
923 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 292 0 R
/E (It is also important to note that industry practices may vary significantly by region. Corporate beauty roles in Asia and Europe, for example, may differ in terms of structure, culture, and hiring pathways. Most of our interviewees are based in Europe, with the exception of the former Director of eCommerce at Sephora Korea. As such, these insights should be understood as general guidance rather than fixed rules, and may differ depending on local context.)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
