/Pg 44 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
927 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 293 0 R
/T (Q: What is a typical daily routine for a Sephora professional? What are the "Core Tasks" that take up the largest portion of your work? A: The core tasks vary depending on the position, but the primary focus across all regions was driving sales growth and strengthening brand presence. Regarding the daily routine, the workload is generally split into 70% local business operations and 30% global collaboration. As Sephora Korea is part of the APAC region, our systems and tasks were closely linked with the Regional HQ in Singapore. While actual decision-making happened in Korea, we collaborated continuously with the global team to leverage their established experience within the APAC market.)
/E (Q: What is a typical daily routine for a Sephora professional? What are the "Core Tasks" that take up the largest portion of your work? A: The core tasks vary depending on the position, but the primary focus across all regions was driving sales growth and strengthening brand presence. Regarding the daily routine, the workload is generally split into 70% local business operations and 30% global collaboration. As Sephora Korea is part of the APAC region, our systems and tasks were closely linked with the Regional HQ in Singapore. While actual decision-making happened in Korea, we collaborated continuously with the global team to leverage their established experience within the APAC market.)
/Pg 45 0 R
/K [0]
>>
