/T (A: Single-brand distribution focuses heavily on production dependency rather than sourcing. In contrast, a multi-brand retailer functions more as a platform, where product sourcing, price negotiation, inventory management, and sales consultations play a much larger role. Since Sephora acts as both a retailer and a brand owner \(Sephora Collection\), it was crucial to achieve two goals: providing fair promotional opportunities to maintain stable partnerships while simultaneously driving overall revenue growth.)
