/T (Q: What is the biggest gap you see in new hires who lack a fashion or beauty background, and how can they realistically overcome this before applying? A: The biggest issue is terminology. Beauty has its own set of industry terms that differ from fashion, some of which are used as global standards. If you are not familiar with these, communication costs increase. Since this is hard to cover purely through pre-entry study, we typically provide internal training and share a glossary of terms after the hire joins.)
