/T (Q: Is there anything you would do differently during your student years if your goal was to enter LVMH? A: Looking back, I would approach my career with a more flexible mindset. Initially, I was focused on the beauty industry and did not specifically aim to enter LVMH or luxury. However, I realized that career paths are often shaped by experience, and it is important not to be too fixed on a specific role or brand from the beginning. Instead of focusing on a single target, it is more effective to take incremental steps that bring you closer to the industry, even if they are not exactly what you initially envisioned. For example, if your goal is to work at a brand like Dior, starting in a related role, such as working in a store or within a subsidiary, can still be a valuable entry point. Over time, as you gain more exposure, you develop a clearer understanding of your interests and can adjust your direction accordingly.)
/E (Q: Is there anything you would do differently during your student years if your goal was to enter LVMH? A: Looking back, I would approach my career with a more flexible mindset. Initially, I was focused on the beauty industry and did not specifically aim to enter LVMH or luxury. However, I realized that career paths are often shaped by experience, and it is important not to be too fixed on a specific role or brand from the beginning. Instead of focusing on a single target, it is more effective to take incremental steps that bring you closer to the industry, even if they are not exactly what you initially envisioned. For example, if your goal is to work at a brand like Dior, starting in a related role, such as working in a store or within a subsidiary, can still be a valuable entry point. Over time, as you gain more exposure, you develop a clearer understanding of your interests and can adjust your direction accordingly.)
/Pg 53 0 R
/K [1]
>>
