/T (Q: What does your day look like in your role, and what responsibilities take up most of your time? A: I spent most of my time restocking and serving clients. We get shipped new products on Wednesday/Friday, and then we reorganize and catalog everything. But the major responsibility is serving clients. Compared to Korea, where everyone does their own thing, people in Italy love to get advice and recommendations from workers. A lot of my day is spent talking to clients.)
