/E (A: I completed my undergraduate degree at Yonsei University, majoring in Communication. After graduating, I worked for two years in Korea as a music marketing manager in the entertainment industry. I later transitioned into the eyewear industry, starting as a freelancer and eventually becoming a full-time e-commerce and marketing operator at a Korean eyewear brand. My involvement in this industry actually began during my freshman year, when I worked at a showroom in Hongdae. Over time, I built relationships within the company and gradually moved into roles in the global department. I am currently working at Thelios as part of my MBA program in France.)
/Pg 56 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
990 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
