/P 304 0 R
/E (Most of my career opportunities came through networking rather than formal applications. For example, I was introduced to my first showroom role through a friend, and I later connected with professionals through casual conversations and coffee chats. I never directly applied to LVMH; when I made plans to go to France for my Masters, I reached out to Professor Tae, and she introduced me to a Yonsei alumnus who was in France, and she recommended me to the recruiter.)
/Pg 56 0 R
/K [2]
>>
