992 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 304 0 R
/E (A: Trade marketing is very different from regular marketing. My role is mainly focused on project management at the headquarters level, where I am part of the decision-making team rather than working on regional execution. I manage global trade marketing projects, particularly for Dior eyewear, where I evaluate proposals from regional teams and decide whether they should move forward. If approved, I oversee the entire process, from design and production to final implementation, acting as the link between the brand, regional teams, clients \(such as department stores or opticians\), designers, and suppliers.)
/Pg 56 0 R
/K [4]
>>
