/T (Salary progression, however, does not always keep pace with promotions. It is common for professionals to change companies every few years to achieve higher salaries or better positions. Compared to Korea, where salary increases may be higher but promotion to senior roles is more limited, France offers more structured career progression but slower salary growth. For international employees, this can mean staying in more junior roles while gradually increasing compensation, often by moving between companies.)
/E (Salary progression, however, does not always keep pace with promotions. It is common for professionals to change companies every few years to achieve higher salaries or better positions. Compared to Korea, where salary increases may be higher but promotion to senior roles is more limited, France offers more structured career progression but slower salary growth. For international employees, this can mean staying in more junior roles while gradually increasing compensation, often by moving between companies.)
