/Title (That said, it is still possible to build a pathway into the industry by developing relevant exposure. It does not have to be directly in luxury, but having some connection to the industry is important. This can include internships, part-time roles in retail, or any experience related to brands you are interested in. Demonstrating genuine interest and passion is especially important, as the luxury market is currently quite competitive and companies are becoming more selective in their hiring.)
