/Title (Language is another major barrier. While my Korean is relatively strong, my French is not at the same level, which made the job search more challenging. In fact, the role I applied for initially required French speakers. However, I was still able to secure the position by demonstrating relevant experience and strong capabilities. I became the first non-French-speaking member of the Dior team, which was unexpected for many people. Although I can understand some French, I had to rely on my experience to compensate for this gap.)
